2	 * AuthService — local-only authentication, session, and password management.
3	 *
4	 * Responsibilities:
5	 *   - username/password login and logout
6	 *   - password validation (min 12 chars, ≥1 digit, ≥1 symbol)
7	 *   - guest trial session (read-only, 30-minute hard expiry)
8	 *   - inactivity auto-lock (10 minutes)
9	 *   - password change with session-key rotation
10	 *   - account deactivation
11	 *   - RBAC role resolution
12	 */
